PASCO BLE TypeScript Library License

Copyright (c) 2024 Martin Veillette

This TypeScript library is an independent implementation for interfacing with
PASCO wireless BLE sensors. This work was inspired by and developed with
reference to PASCO Scientific's original Python implementation, which is
subject to the license terms below.

