ACKNOWLEDGMENT OF ORIGINAL WORK
================================================================================

This TypeScript implementation acknowledges and honors the original work by
PASCO Scientific. The protocol specifications, sensor datasheets, and
communication methods were referenced from PASCO's Python implementation:

    Copyright (c) 2021 PASCO Scientific

While this TypeScript library is an independent implementation with its own
architecture and code, users must respect PASCO Scientific's intellectual
property rights and trademark ownership.

